   "id": "h65",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"display\">Raise</span><span class=\"rp-sub\">~2–3 min</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h66",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Lift the heart rate, temperature, and blood flow — gently. Use the no-hop, step-out versions if a knee or Achilles is cranky."
  },
  {
   "id": "h67",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<a class=\"ex\" data-video=\"https://pub-40102464ff0f4d61a636f1749e9d3111.r2.dev/butt_kicks.mp4\" href=\"https://elitehockeydrills.com/exercises/butt-kicks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Butt Kicks<span class=\"lk\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>"
  },
  {
