  },
  {
   "id": "h88",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<a class=\"ex\" data-video=\"https://pub-40102464ff0f4d61a636f1749e9d3111.r2.dev/lateral_squat_shift.mp4\" href=\"https://elitehockeydrills.com/exercises/lateral-squat-shift\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lateral Squat Shift<span class=\"lk\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h89",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<a class=\"ex\" data-video=\"https://pub-40102464ff0f4d61a636f1749e9d3111.r2.dev/inchworm_to_push_up.mp4\" href=\"https://elitehockeydrills.com/exercises/inchworm-to-push-up\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Inchworm to Push-Up<span class=\"lk\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h90",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"bg-name\"><span class=\"bg-num\">2</span> Movement &amp; Speed</span><span class=\"bg-mins\">8–12 min</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h91",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"ex-idx\">01</span>\n              <a class=\"ex\" data-video=\"https://pub-40102464ff0f4d61a636f1749e9d3111.r2.dev/drop_squat.mp4\" href=\"https://elitehockeydrills.com/exercises/drop-squat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Drop Squat<span class=\"lk\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h92",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"spec\"><b>3×4</b></span>\n              <span class=\"spec dim\">X · stick</span>\n              <span class=\"spec rest\">REST 45s</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h93",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Sharp drop into a strong, balanced stance. Freeze it."
  },
  {
   "id": "h94",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"ex-idx\">02</span>\n              <a class=\"ex\" data-video=\"https://pub-40102464ff0f4d61a636f1749e9d3111.r2.dev/skater_hop_stick_it.mp4\" href=\"https://elitehockeydrills.com/exercises/skater-hop-stick-it\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Skater Hop — Stick It<span class=\"lk\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h95",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"spec\"><b>3×4/side</b></span>\n              <span class=\"spec dim\">X · bound + stick</span>\n              <span class=\"spec rest\">REST 60s</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h96",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "A touch more push, still land soft and stick each one balanced."
  },
  {
   "id": "h97",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"bg-name\"><span class=\"bg-num\">3</span> Main Work</span><span class=\"bg-mins\">15–20 min</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h98",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"ex-idx\">01</span>\n              <a class=\"ex\" data-video=\"https://pub-40102464ff0f4d61a636f1749e9d3111.r2.dev/banded_squat_jump.mp4\" href=\"https://elitehockeydrills.com/exercises/banded-squat-jump\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Banded Squat Jump<span class=\"lk\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h99",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"spec\"><b>4×4</b></span>\n              <span class=\"spec dim\">X · moderate · soft</span>\n              <span class=\"spec rest\">REST 90s</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h100",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Top (moderate) amplitude for the program, soft and silent landings, full reset. Still no max-impact pounding."
  },
  {
   "id": "h101",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"ex-idx\">02</span>\n              <a class=\"ex\" data-video=\"https://pub-40102464ff0f4d61a636f1749e9d3111.r2.dev/lateral_skater_bound.mp4\" href=\"https://elitehockeydrills.com/exercises/lateral-skater-bound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lateral Skater Bound<span class=\"lk\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h102",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"spec\"><b>3×4/side</b></span>\n              <span class=\"spec dim\">X · stick each</span>\n              <span class=\"spec rest\">REST 60s</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h103",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Powerful sideways push, cover ground, land soft and STICK each one. No continuous rebounding."
  },
  {
   "id": "h104",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"ex-idx\">03</span>\n              <a class=\"ex\" data-video=\"https://pub-40102464ff0f4d61a636f1749e9d3111.r2.dev/db_rdl.mp4\" href=\"https://elitehockeydrills.com/exercises/db-rdl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">DB RDL<span class=\"lk\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h105",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"spec\"><b>3×8</b></span>\n              <span class=\"spec dim\">3011 · light</span>\n              <span class=\"spec rest\">REST 60s</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h106",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Hinge, light DBs down the thighs, flat back. Back bothers you? Switch to Banded RDL (lightest at the bottom)."
  },
  {
   "id": "h107",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"ex-idx\">04</span>\n              <a class=\"ex\" data-video=\"https://pub-40102464ff0f4d61a636f1749e9d3111.r2.dev/banded_standing_adduction.mp4\" href=\"https://elitehockeydrills.com/exercises/banded-standing-adduction\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Banded Standing Adduction<span class=\"lk\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h108",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"spec\"><b>3×12/side</b></span>\n              <span class=\"spec dim\">groin</span>\n              <span class=\"spec rest\">REST 30s</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h109",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Squeeze the inner thigh, control it back. Protect the groin."
  },
  {
   "id": "h110",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"ex-idx\">05</span>\n              <a class=\"ex\" data-video=\"https://pub-40102464ff0f4d61a636f1749e9d3111.r2.dev/band_row.mp4\" href=\"https://elitehockeydrills.com/exercises/band-row\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Band Row<span class=\"lk\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h111",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"spec\"><b>3×12</b></span>\n              <span class=\"spec dim\">2011 · squeeze</span>\n              <span class=\"spec rest\">REST 45s</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h112",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Anchor a band in front; drive the elbows back and squeeze the shoulder blades, tall chest — do not lean back. Pulling strength and posture insurance against all the forward-skating and pressing. Go to a heavier band as it gets easy."
  },
  {
   "id": "h113",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"bg-name\"><span class=\"bg-num\">4</span> Conditioning &amp; Core</span><span class=\"bg-mins\">14–17 min</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h114",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"ex-idx\">01</span>\n              <a class=\"ex\" href=\"https://elitehockeydrills.com/exercises/aerobic-circuit-zone-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Aerobic Circuit (Zone 2)<span class=\"lk\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h115",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"spec\"><b>12–14 min</b></span>\n              <span class=\"spec dim\">easy · steady</span>\n              <span class=\"spec rest\">—</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h116",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Easy, continuous low-impact cardio — brisk walk, easy bike or row, light marching / step-ups, or easy skipping. Keep it conversational: you can talk or nose-breathe the whole time (~60–70%). No stopping, no grind."
  },
  {
   "id": "h117",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"ex-idx\">02</span>\n              <a class=\"ex\" data-video=\"https://pub-40102464ff0f4d61a636f1749e9d3111.r2.dev/banded_chop_lift.mp4\" href=\"https://elitehockeydrills.com/exercises/banded-chop-lift\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Banded Chop / Lift<span class=\"lk\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h118",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"spec\"><b>2×8/side</b></span>\n              <span class=\"spec dim\">rotate · brace</span>\n              <span class=\"spec rest\">REST 40s</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h119",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Pull the band diagonally across the body — high-to-low, then low-to-high — bracing so the trunk does not rotate. Control the return."
  },
  {
   "id": "h120",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"bg-name\"><span class=\"bg-num\">5</span> Cool-Down &amp; Recovery</span><span class=\"bg-mins\">5–8 min</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h121",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "C"
  },
  {
   "id": "h122",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"display\">Cool-Down</span><span class=\"rp-sub\">~5–8 min</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h123",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Easy, unhurried stretches — slow the breath and let the heart rate settle."
  },
  {
   "id": "h124",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<a class=\"ex\" href=\"https://elitehockeydrills.com/exercises/slow-walk-with-nose-breathing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Slow Walk with Nose Breathing<span class=\"lk\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h125",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<a class=\"ex\" data-video=\"https://pub-40102464ff0f4d61a636f1749e9d3111.r2.dev/child_s_pose_with_breath.mp4\" href=\"https://elitehockeydrills.com/exercises/child-s-pose-with-breath\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Child's Pose with Breath<span class=\"lk\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h126",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<a class=\"ex\" data-video=\"https://pub-40102464ff0f4d61a636f1749e9d3111.r2.dev/supine_spinal_twist.mp4\" href=\"https://elitehockeydrills.com/exercises/supine-spinal-twist\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Supine Spinal Twist<span class=\"lk\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h127",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<a class=\"ex\" data-video=\"https://pub-40102464ff0f4d61a636f1749e9d3111.r2.dev/hip_groin_flow.mp4\" href=\"https://elitehockeydrills.com/exercises/hip-groin-flow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Hip / Groin Flow<span class=\"lk\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>"
  },
  {
   "id": "a128",
   "kind": "attr:alt",
   "en": "Coach David Ciboch, M.Ed. Sport Science, performing a barbell squat"
  },
  {
   "id": "h129",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"cb-dot\"></span><span><b>Coach David Ciboch</b><span>M.Ed. Sport Science · National-Team S&amp;C</span></span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h130",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Who built this"
  },
  {
   "id": "h131",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Coached at the <em>national-team level.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h132",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "SUSTAIN isn’t a template from the internet. Every session was periodized by <strong style=\"color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;\">Coach David Ciboch</strong> — M.Ed. Sport Science, a decade of coaching through to the UAE National Ice Hockey Team, built for veteran players whose priority is staying fast and staying healthy."
  },
  {
   "id": "h133",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Master’s Degree (M.Ed.) — PE &amp; Sport Science"
  },
  {
   "id": "h134",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Certified Strength &amp; Conditioning Coach"
  },
  {
   "id": "h135",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Former National Team Coach — UAE Ice Hockey"
  },
  {
   "id": "h136",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "1,000+ athletes developed across 30+ countries"
  },
  {
   "id": "h137",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "02 — What's Inside"
  },
  {
   "id": "h138",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Everything you need to <em>keep playing.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h139",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "A complete, coach-built block of off-ice training — written for a 40+ body and how it actually recovers, not a generic gym plan."
  },
  {
   "id": "h140",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "24 Coach-Built Sessions"
  },
  {
   "id": "h141",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Three sessions a week (Mon/Wed/Fri) for eight weeks, each about 50–70 minutes. Every session follows the same five-part shape — just run them in order."
  },
  {
   "id": "h142",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Video for Every Exercise"
  },
  {
   "id": "h143",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "No guessing what a move looks like. Every single exercise links to a clean demo video you can copy in seconds."
  },
  {
   "id": "h144",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "5 Durability Checkpoints"
  },
  {
   "id": "h145",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Five simple, measurable checkpoints — a real number to beat at Week 1, 4 and 8. Proof you're getting stronger and more durable, not just older."
  },
  {
   "id": "h146",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Easier &amp; Harder Scaling"
  },
  {
   "id": "h147",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Every move comes with a simpler version and a harder version — so it fits whether you're easing back in or still playing competitively."
  },
  {
   "id": "h148",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "The RAMP Warm-Up"
  },
  {
   "id": "h149",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "A built-in 10–12 minute warm-up before every session — Raise, Activate, Mobilize, Prime — the difference-maker for a 40+ body: you walk out healthy, not sore the next day."
  },
  {
   "id": "h150",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Full Glossary &amp; Notes"
  },
  {
   "id": "h151",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Plain-English coaching notes and a complete glossary — so you always know what to do, why it's dosed that way, and when to back off."
  },
  {
   "id": "h152",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "03 — The Plan"
  },
  {
   "id": "h153",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "The 8-week <em>journey.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h154",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Two four-week blocks. Volume nudges to a peak, then unloads — twice — so you arrive at every checkpoint fresh and durable, not buried."
  },
  {
   "id": "h155",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"jb-label\">Block 1</span><span class=\"jb-weeks\">Weeks 1–4</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h156",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Rebuild &amp; Strengthen"
  },
  {
   "id": "h157",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Re-establish joint prep, mobility, balance, single-leg control, and band/bodyweight strength on durable tissue. Landing-led plyos only — no real jumps yet. Volume nudges Week 1→3, then Week 4 deloads and you re-check."
  },
  {
   "id": "h158",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"jb-label\">Block 2</span><span class=\"jb-weeks\">Weeks 5–8</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h159",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Power &amp; Sustain"
  },
  {
   "id": "h160",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Introduce moderate-amplitude power with soft landings, smoother near-top speed, and solo conditioning and core finishers. Volume peaks Week 7, then Week 8 tapers into recovery and the final checkpoint."
  },
  {
   "id": "h161",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Block 1 rebuilds the movement and strength base; Block 2 extends moderate power and speed — so the whole athlete shifts up and to the right, without beating up the body. A faster, more durable player, built to keep playing."
  },
  {
   "id": "h162",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"ms-wk\">Week 4</span><span class=\"ms-txt\">Deload + re-check</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h163",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"ms-wk\">Week 8</span><span class=\"ms-txt\">Taper + final checkpoint</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h164",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "04 — A Week"
  },
  {
   "id": "h165",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "The weekly <em>rhythm.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h166",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Three sessions a week — Monday, Wednesday, Friday — with a full rest day between every one. The three days rotate focus so the whole athlete gets built, with nothing overloaded."
  },
  {
   "id": "h167",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Day 1 · Mon"
  },
  {
   "id": "h168",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Strength &amp; Quality"
  },
  {
   "id": "h169",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Hinge, single-leg, groin, and core — rebuilding strength on durable tissue, the foundation that keeps you on the ice."
  },
  {
   "id": "h170",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Day 2 · Wed"
  },
  {
   "id": "h171",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Speed &amp; Reactive"
  },
  {
   "id": "h172",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Linear mechanics, footwork, and core — keeping your feet quick and your first step alive."
  },
  {
   "id": "h173",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Day 3 · Fri"
  },
  {
   "id": "h174",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Power &amp; Express"
  },
  {
   "id": "h175",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Soft landings, deceleration, and posterior-chain power — moderate, joint-friendly explosiveness you can actually recover from."
  },
  {
   "id": "h176",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "A full rest day sits between every session — never back-to-back. After 40, tendons recover slower than muscle, so the Mon/Wed/Fri spacing is the program, not a suggestion."
  },
  {
   "id": "h177",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "05 — Proof"
  },
  {
   "id": "h178",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Progress you can <em>measure.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h179",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Five simple checkpoints — every one gives you a number to beat. Re-test at Week 1, 4 and 8. Proof you're more durable, not just older."
  },
  {
   "id": "h180",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"skill-n\">01</span><span class=\"skill-gain\">+5–15 cm</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h181",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Broad Jump"
  },
  {
   "id": "h182",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Lower-body power (horizontal)"
  },
